-    "body": "Last updated: October 21, 2026\n\nThis Privacy Policy explains how Maksym Babiev, an individual trader trading as \"Knowly\" (\"Knowly\", \"we\", \"us\", or \"our\"), collects, uses, discloses, stores, and deletes information when you use the Phraseman iOS app (the \"App\"), related cloud features, and Knowly website pages for Phraseman. The data controller is Maksym Babiev, Ardagh, Ballymackerry, V42 P599, Ireland. Privacy contact: support.phraseman@gmail.com.\n\nThis Policy is intended to describe the App's current iOS data practices. If an App Store listing, in-app notice, or consent screen gives more specific information for a particular feature, that notice also applies."
