     "heading": "7. Friends, referrals, invite codes, and rewards",
-    "body": "Friend, gift, referral, invite, and reward features may process friend codes, friend relationships, friend requests, the list of users you have blocked (blocking also removes that person from your friends and stops their friend requests to you; the blocked person is not told who blocked them), activity feed entries, activity likes, invite links, referral codes, referral owners, referral attributions, referrer/referee stable IDs, reward status, reward roulette spins and outcomes, coin ledger entries, limits, cooldowns, abuse checks, and deep-link or manual-code source information.\n\nWe use this information to operate the feature, attribute rewards, prevent self-referrals and abuse, enforce caps and cooldowns, correct errors, and protect the App."
